        "sources/run.sh:check() compares stdout with `cmp -s` against the expected text, so a PASS means byte equality"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "st-006",
      "verdict": "MET",
      "rationale": "Account add, get, rename, and delete, and transaction post, get, amend, and delete, all worked, and absent records exited 4.",
